# Waits that remain in the D3D12 driver, checked by
# tools/d3d12_idle_wait_check.c: file|function|call|count. A new
# d3d12_queue_drain or SetEventOnCompletion in the checked files fails
# CI unless it is added here, and an entry whose call is gone fails
# too. Do not add to this list to make a stall go away: a frame waits
# for its predecessor's own signal (d3d12_cmd_begin), and anything
# else a frame may still read goes behind its fence (d3d12_retire).
#
# The bounded wait every own-fence wait goes through.
gfx/drivers/d3d12.c|d3d12_fence_wait|SetEventOnCompletion|1
#
# Lifecycle drains: driver teardown, a shader preset swapped, the font
# rebuilt, a hardware core's textures changing size, the retired list
# unable to grow, and the swap chain resized (the last Present still
# holds a back buffer; the check also requires this one).
gfx/drivers/d3d12.c|d3d12_gfx_free|d3d12_queue_drain|1
gfx/drivers/d3d12.c|d3d12_gfx_frame_body|d3d12_queue_drain|1
gfx/drivers/d3d12.c|d3d12_gfx_set_shader|d3d12_queue_drain|1
gfx/drivers/d3d12.c|d3d12_shader_load_step|d3d12_queue_drain|1
gfx/drivers/d3d12.c|d3d12_font_free|d3d12_queue_drain|1
gfx/drivers/d3d12.c|d3d12_hw_direct_lookup|d3d12_queue_drain|1
gfx/drivers/d3d12.c|d3d12_retire|d3d12_queue_drain|1
#
# Synchronous readback (screenshots): the copy has to be finished to
# be read.
gfx/drivers/d3d12.c|d3d12_gfx_read_viewport|d3d12_queue_drain|2
gfx/drivers/d3d12.c|d3d12_gfx_read_viewport_hdr|d3d12_queue_drain|2
#
# Hardware core handoff: waits on the core's own fences, which the
# core asks for (wait_sync_index, the ring's fence wait), or before
# their objects go.
gfx/drivers/d3d12.c|d3d12_hw_v2_wait_sync_index|SetEventOnCompletion|1
gfx/drivers/d3d12.c|d3d12_hw_ring_fence_wait|SetEventOnCompletion|1
gfx/drivers/d3d12.c|d3d12_hw_ring_capture|SetEventOnCompletion|1
gfx/drivers/d3d12.c|d3d12_hw_ring_free|SetEventOnCompletion|1
